SUMMARY:Così Fan Tutte - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW Wadebridge
DESCRIPTION:Così Fan Tutte - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (3h 30min)\n
 \nSpurred on by a bet\, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of
  their girlfriends. What follows is a slippery game of seduction and power
 \, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting reality\, wh
 ere truth becomes increasingly unstable. \nCosì fan tutte has lost none o
 f its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stag
 e debut\, Netia Jones\, Associate Director of The Royal Opera\, reimagines
  Mozart's comedy of manners through a sharp contemporary lens\, where 18th
 -century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical high-tech deceit. Taking
  on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder\
 , Simone McIntosh\, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall\, with Gerald Fin
 ley as their manipulative game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as De
 spina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts\, bringing out the exquisite melodies t
 hat underpin the provocative\, and resolutely modern\, themes at the heart
  of the opera.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Wadebridge\nBook tickets: ht
 tps://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5561/cos-fan-tutte-royal-ballet-ope
 ra-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-cinemas/fil
 ms/cos-fan-tutte-royal-ballet-opera-26-27-season.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Wadebridge
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/wadebridge/film/5561/cos-fan-tutte-royal-balle
 t-opera-2627-season
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
